    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an executive health and stress-prevention AI assistant. \n\nUSER PROFILE:\n- Name: {{ $('user_info').item.json.Name }}\n- Role: {{ $('user_info').item.json.Role }}\n- Stress Tolerance: {{ $('user_info').item.json.Stress_Tolerance }}\n- Preferred Reset Method: {{ $('user_info').item.json.Preferred_Reset }}\n\nCALENDAR DATA:\n- Full Week Events:\n{{ $('week_density').all().map(item => `- ${item.json.summary || 'Busy'} (From: ${item.json.start.dateTime } To: ${item.json.end.dateTime })`).join('\\n') }}\n\n- Today's Events:\n{{ $('todays_appointments').all().map(item => `- ${item.json.summary || 'Busy'} (From ${item.json.start.dateTime} To: ${item.json.end.dateTime} `).join('\\n') }}\n\nTASK:\n1. Analyze the work density for the entire week (count total meetings and notice heavy back-to-back blocks).\n2. Analyze today's specific schedule.\n3. Evaluate the burnout risk level (Low, Medium, High, or Critical) based on the user's stress tolerance and schedule density of the week.\n4. Recommend a short, specific stress-relief action tailored to their preferred reset method ({{ $('user_info').item.json.Preferred_Reset }}).\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\nAlways return the response in this exact layout:\nReturn strictly a JSON object with only two keys:\n{\n  \"risk_level\": \"Low\", \n  \"email\": {\n    \"title\": \"email title\"\n    \"body\": \"email body\",\n  }\n}\nThe body of the email should short, easy to read, contain text formatted with week density, daily density, reset action, and mandatory disclaimer.\"\n\nRules for risk_level: Must strictly be one of these exact words: \"Low\", \"Medium\", \"High\", or \"Critical\".",
        "needsFallback": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        848,
        0
      ],
      "id": "823cf6f5-c204-40d2-9b08-c953b7e7086d",
